@startuml connection-setup
title US-02: Connection Setup - WebSocket Handshake

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBorderColor #555555
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

actor Operator
participant "Angular\nDashboard" as Dashboard
participant "Express API\n(ws library)" as API

Operator -> Dashboard : opens live map

Dashboard -> API : HTTP GET /live\nUpgrade: websocket

note over API
  Express HTTP server and ws library
  share the same port.
  No separate WebSocket server process.
end note

API --> Dashboard : 101 Switching Protocols\n(WebSocket handshake complete)

note over Dashboard
  Connection is persistent.
  Dashboard does not poll.
  Server pushes updates as they arrive.
end note

Dashboard --> Operator : map rendered, awaiting live updates

== On disconnect ==

Dashboard -> Dashboard : detect connection drop
Dashboard -> API : reconnect (exponential backoff)
API --> Dashboard : 101 Switching Protocols
Dashboard --> Operator : live updates resume

@enduml
